OL,3,GNEWSAFear that care reforms ignore
OL,4,Adisabled people
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has described his plan for
OL,7,Fa national care service as "a landmark
OL,8,Fpolicy as significant as the creation
OL,9,Fof the NHS itself".
OL,11,FBut charities have raised concerns that
OL,12,Fwhen the prime minister announced his
OL,13,Fproposals, he made no mention of
OL,14,Fdisabled people and only referred to
OL,15,Fcare for pensioners.
OL,17,FWhile the government has said a social
OL,18,Fcare review is taking place, Disability
OL,19,FRights UK said it feared disabled
OL,20,Fpeople were "invisible".
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
