OL,3,GNEWSAFear that care reforms ignore
OL,4,Adisabled people
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC has spoken to service users and
OL,7,Fcare providers at Thornage Hall in
OL,8,FNorfolk, which has warned not enough
OL,9,Fattention is paid to the needs of those
OL,10,Fwith learning disabilities and that
OL,11,F"focusing on older age is just one part
OL,12,Fof the problem".
